n    </header>\n    <main class=\"container\" id=\"reportsPage\">\n        <h1>Seller Reports</h1>\n        <p>This page can host simple sales summaries (e.g., total revenue, number of orders). For the beginner project, it displays a placeholder.</p>\n        <div id=\"summary\"></div>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"footer\"><p>&copy; 2026 Simple E‑Commerce</p></footer>\n    <script src=\"../assets/js/storage.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../assets/js/auth.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"../assets/js/main.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"reports.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\MY-PC\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\seller\\reports.html"}}]}
