{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:24:20Z","model":"gpt-oss-120b-medium","input_tokens":18076,"cache_read_tokens":28498,"output_tokens":1000,"thinking":"We have created seller pages and JS. Need add-product.js, manage-products.js, manage-orders.js, reports.js.\n\nImplement add-product: need to load categories, submit form, store product with pending status, sellerId.\n\nImplement manage-products: display list of seller's products, edit/delete, show status and rejection remarks.\n\nImplement manage-orders: show orders where items contain seller's products, allow status update.\n\nImplement reports: simple placeholder could compute total revenue etc.\n\nAlso need to ensure that existing navigation works: main.js builds nav based on role; for seller role navigation already includes seller/dashboard.html.\n\nPotential missing: main.js currently adds link to seller dashboard; it's fine.\n\nWe must be careful with relative paths: JS files reside in seller folder, so they import storage.js via \"../assets/js/storage.js\". Already done.\n\nImplement add-product.js.\n\nImplement edit product: could reuse same form? For simplicity we can have edit functionality via prompts.\n\nSimplify: In manage-products, each product card includes Edit and Delete buttons; Edit opens a prompt for each field (or redirect to edit-product.html – not required in spec). The spec only asked for edit product details – we can implement inline edit via modal prompts.\n\nAlso ensure that when a seller edits a product, status should revert to pending? Not required but typical; we can leave status unchanged unless we want to set to pending again for admin again; but not essential.\n\nImplement manage-products.js: fetch seller products, render each with details, status, and edit/delete.\n\nImplement manage-orders.js: display orders with order ID, customer name (need to look up user), product name, quantity, date, status. Provide a dropdown to change status (Placed, Packed, Shipped, Delivered). When changed, update order.deliveryStatus, also reflect in storage.\n\nImplement reports.js: compute total orders, total revenue for this seller.\n\nLet's code these files.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"// add-product.js – handles new product creation for sellers\n(function(){\n    const storage = window.StorageAPI;\n    const sess = storage.getSession();\n    if(!sess || sess.role!=='seller'){\n        alert('Please log in as a seller');\n        window.location.href='../login.html';\n        return;\n    }\n    const categorySelect = document.getElementById('category');\n    const msgDiv = document.getElementById('msg');\n\n    // Populate categories dropdown\n    const categories = storage.get(storage.keys.categories) || [];\n    categories.forEach(cat=>{\n        const opt = document.createElement('option');\n        opt.value = cat.id;\n        opt.textContent = cat.name;\n        categorySelect.appendChild(opt);\n    });\n\n    document.getElementById('addProductForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\n        e.preventDefault();\n        const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();\n        const description = document.getElementById('description').value.trim();\n        const categoryId = document.getElementById('category').value;\n        const price = parseFloat(document.getElementById('price').value);\n        const stock = parseInt(document.getElementById('stock').value);\n        const image = document.getElementById('image').value.trim();\n        if(!name || !description || !categoryId || isNaN(price) || isNaN(stock) || !image){\n            msgDiv.textContent = 'Please fill in all fields.';\n            msgDiv.style.color = 'red';\n            return;\n        }\n        const products = storage.get(storage.keys.products) || [];\n        const newProduct = {\n            id: 'p-' + crypto.randomUUID(),\n            sellerId: sess.userId,\n            categoryId,\n            name,\n            description,\n            price,\n            stock,\n            image,\n            rating: 0,\n            reviewCount: 0,\n            status: 'pending',\n            createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n            rejectionRemarks: ''\n        };\n        products.push(newProduct);\n        storage.set(storage.keys.products, products);\n        msgDiv.textContent = 'Product added and pending approval.';\n        msgDiv.style.color = 'green';\n        // reset form\n        e.target.reset();\n    });\n})();","Path":"C:\\Users\\MY-PC\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\seller\\add-product.js"}}]}
